    ("arizonarivet-injectedrivets-synthetik-S005161-eva-g_12223", "arizonarivet-injectedrivets-synthetik-S005161-eva-g", "arizona-rivet-border-kids-synthetik-soft-birki-gray-taupe", "Arizona Rivet Border Kids Synthetik", "Arizona Rivets Kids", "Synthetics", "Soft Birki Gray Taupe", "12223", 64.97, 99.95, "", "Girls", "Two-strap sandals", "Classic", "1031589/1031646", "1031646", "The BIRKENSTOCK Arizona is a genuine classic that has been delighting wearers with its timeless design for decades. The two-strap model fits kids\u2019 feet perfectly \u2013 even during boisterous play! This version features precisely positioned rivets with no back which are made to sit firmly in the leather in an elaborate production process without going too deep, making them unnoticeable when the shoe is worn. Quite an eye-catcher! The upper is made from a skin-friendly synthetic material with a velvety feel.", 0.0, 0, "kids", ["kids", "kids-girls-sandals", "style-arizona"], ["products/p-arizona-rivet-border-kids-synthetik-soft-birki-gray-taupe-12223-1.jpg", "products/p-arizona-rivet-border-kids-synthetik-soft-birki-gray-taupe-12223-2.jpg"]),
