    ("prescott-oiledleather-naturalleatheroiled-S005524-rubber-u_1", "prescott-oiledleather-naturalleatheroiled-S005524-rubber-u", "prescott-natural-leather-oiled-black", "Prescott Natural Leather Oiled", "Prescott Lace", "Oiled Leather", "Black", "1", 240.0, None, "VIP Access", "Unisex", "Boots", "Shoes", "1032785/1032809", "1032785/1032809", "The BIRKENSTOCK Prescott Lace is a sturdy shoe. The ankle-high lace-up boot can be combined with many sporty and casual outfits and can be worn in any weather thanks to the mudguard. The comfy and light Deep Blue Footbed makes the shoe a perfect 24/7 all-rounder, especially on long and active days. This version features a high-quality rubber outsole with a professionally inspired tread that offers excellent traction. Biomechanically positioned tread elements promote a natural movement and ensure maximum comfort when walking. The upper is made from extra thick, oiled nubuck leather with an open-selvage finish.", 0.0, 0, "unisex", ["men", "men-shoes", "men-shoes-boots"], ["products/p-prescott-natural-leather-oiled-black-1-1.jpg", "products/p-prescott-natural-leather-oiled-black-1-2.jpg", "products/p-prescott-natural-leather-oiled-black-1-3.jpg"]),
