    ("prescottlow-oiledleather-naturalleatheroiled-S005525-rubber-u_11984", "prescottlow-oiledleather-naturalleatheroiled-S005525-rubber-u", "prescott-low-oiled-leather-natural-leather-oiled-basalt-gray", "Prescott Low Oiled Leather Natural Leather Oiled", "Prescott Low Oiled Leather", "Oiled Leather", "Basalt Gray", "11984", 220.0, None, "VIP Access", "Unisex", "Lace-up shoes", "Shoes", "1032826/1032828", "1032826/1032828", "The BIRKENSTOCK Prescott Low Lace boasts a sturdy design and versatility when it comes to mixing and matching. Whether for a sporty or a casual style, this lace-up shoe will round off all kinds of looks, while its mudguard offers reliable protection whatever the weather. The comfy and light Deep Blue Footbed makes the shoe a perfect 24/7 all-rounder, especially on long and active days. Perfect for your next holiday, extensive walks, or city trips. This version features a high-quality rubber outsole with a professionally inspired tread that offers excellent traction. Biomechanically positioned tread elements promote a natural movement and ensure maximum comfort when walking. The upper is made from extra thick, oiled nubuck leather with an open-selvage finish.", 0.0, 0, "unisex", ["men", "men-shoes", "men-shoes-boots"], ["products/p-prescott-low-oiled-leather-natural-leather-oiled-basalt-gray-11984-1.jpg", "products/p-prescott-low-oiled-leather-natural-leather-oiled-basalt-gray-11984-2.jpg"]),
